  "details": "Im having this error since the last update where animations broke.\nWhen i calibrate the avatar o change the avatar i have a chance of 75% of not been able to activate my animations .(gestures) LOCALLY. My friends can still see them.\nThis happened with all my avatars 2.0 / 3.0 even if they were updated before and after that update that broke stuff.\n\nWhat i tried:\n-Deleting cache\n-Deleting user preferences\n-Uninstall the game and install it again.\n\nOnly way i can still play properly:\nThe only solution i found is go to safety, click on Dyn Bones and it reloads my avatar, that fix it.\nCalibrate or change avatar again just breaks it\n\n0:30 i do the emotes, then calibrate and then they break letting my hands with no animations\nhttps://youtu.be/S92ujY4-fvE",
